From: Xiaomi Mi MIX Linux port contributors
Subject: [PATCH] arm64: dts: qcom: xiaomi-lithium: enable the Venus video codec

Enable Venus with lithium's own signed firmware (from the stock NON-HLOS
image, packaged as qcom/msm8996/lithium/venus.mbn + venus.bNN by
firmware-xiaomi-lithium). On hardware the decoder and encoder register
(/dev/video0, /dev/video1); a 720p H.264 clip decodes bit-exact against
software decoding with about 13 times less CPU, and mpv plays 720p60
YouTube through it at about 10-15 % CPU.

---
--- a/arch/arm64/boot/dts/qcom/msm8996pro-xiaomi-lithium.dts
+++ b/arch/arm64/boot/dts/qcom/msm8996pro-xiaomi-lithium.dts
@@ -803,6 +803,11 @@
 	};
 };
 
+&venus {
+	firmware-name = "qcom/msm8996/lithium/venus.mbn";
+	status = "okay";
+};
+
 &q6asmdai {
 	dai@0 { reg = <MSM_FRONTEND_DAI_MULTIMEDIA1>; };
 	dai@1 { reg = <MSM_FRONTEND_DAI_MULTIMEDIA2>; };
